  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture production (shallots) Beneficiaries: 181 women Description: This capacity building project will provide resources to conduct technical studies to address the lack of water availability at the group&apos;s production site and provide training and technical assistance to strengthen the group&apos;s technical, administrative, financial management, and marketing capabilities.</narrative>
